["desc"] = "|cFF6666FFClassic Skin|r : Progress bars showing the status of all DoTs in a visual way.|n|cFF66FF66Alternative Skin|r : Made by Solah. More compact and uses Icons to display the status of DoTs.",
["type"] = "select",
